    "final": "Alderney Threads is the Wexcombe seller that delivers size M of the tee (Wexcombe Midweight Jersey Tee). Its size M is in stock and selectable (confirmed by adding it to the cart at $19.80), while the other tee sellers on the first results page cannot: Fairhaven Apparel's size M is out of stock (disabled) and Foxcombe Threads does not offer size M at all (the 4th card, Whitlock Outfitters, is the Knit Tee variant, not the tee). Note: the store publishes no shipping/delivery-time estimates on any page (product, listing, cart, checkout, or API), so 'fastest' can only be assessed as immediate deliverability of size M; other tee sellers with M in stock below the first viewport include Brockwell Garments, Verity Clothing Company Ltd, Chandler Workwear Supply Co, Lymington Clothing Company Ltd, Jarrow Textiles Official Store, and Thornbury Apparel Official Store. Among the first-page tee sellers, Alderney Threads is the only one that can deliver size M.",
